.DS_Store
.codegraph/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# CNF and proof files are checked in the run and never committed (PROTOCOL.md §5)
*.cnf
*.drat
*.cnf.gz
*.drat.gz
research/12-faced-polyhedron/overnight/work/
research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/*/results/**/*.lock
research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/*/results/**/launch.pids
# E-261119-02 pass-1 maps (7.7 MB): rebuilt by its stageb.py, pinned by SHA-256 in queue_pass1.json
research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261119-02-symmetric-nine-face-census/maps/pass1.json

# Run-control markers of overnight runs (launch.sh stop); never evidence
stop.requested

# Raw per-unit output of tranche runs (attempt_*/): solver and unit logs, unit specs, maps and control inputs and
# outputs stay outside git, moved to ../polyhedrons-data by research/12-faced-polyhedron/overnight/move_raw.py.
# Git keeps the evidence (PROTOCOL.md section 5): manifests, control summaries, every unit's result.json (other
# experiments read them), every SAT model and every checker transcript.
**/attempt_*/**
!**/attempt_*/*/
!**/attempt_*/manifest.json
!**/attempt_*/controls/manifest.json
!**/attempt_*/controls/summary.json
!**/attempt_*/map*/result.json
!research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261116-02-s6-10-3-cube-pilot/results/run/*/attempt_*/result.json
!**/attempt_*/**/*.model.json
!**/attempt_*/**/*.checker.log
!**/attempt_*/**/*.recheck.log
# E-261113-02 (owner, 2026-11-13): its per-unit result.json and SAT models (18.5 MB, mostly bridge output) live in
# ../polyhedrons-data; git keeps the attempt manifests and each shard's results.jsonl, which summary.py reads.
research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261113-02-s6-10-2-calibration-rung/**/attempt_*/*/**
!research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261113-02-s6-10-2-calibration-rung/**/attempt_*/controls/manifest.json
!research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261113-02-s6-10-2-calibration-rung/**/attempt_*/controls/summary.json
# Exception: the same-path pilot is cited evidence of E-261103-03 (test_tranche checks its output hashes)
!research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261103-03-s5-exact-decision-8-2-9-3/results/coverage_pilot/**

# E-261110-06 (as E-261113-02): per-map seed records, solver logs and empty model files of the owner run live in
# ../polyhedrons-data; git keeps each shard's results.jsonl, manifests and results/night-summary.json (no SAT model).
research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261110-06-s5-10-4-strata-ab-remainder/results/run/*/map*/**

# E-261119-02 pass 1 (owner, 2026-11-20): the 12562 per-map result.json files live in ../polyhedrons-data; git keeps
# each shard's results.jsonl (the same records), manifests, the f9 control units and the runner's control summaries.
research/12-faced-polyhedron/experiments/E-261119-02-symmetric-nine-face-census/results/stageB-pass1/*/attempt_*/map[0-9]*/**

